        <!-- Watchdog Supervisor -->
        <mxCell id="srv_watchdog" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color='#FFFFFF' style='font-size: 14px;'&gt;Watchdog Supervisor&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font color='#A7F3D0' style='font-size: 11px;'&gt;scripts/run-tunnel.sh (/root/run-tunnel.sh)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;hr/&gt;&lt;font color='#E2E8F0' style='font-size: 11px;'&gt;• Auto-restarts Nginx if terminated by HyperOS&lt;br/&gt;• Keeps cloudflared alive with 3s auto-respawn&lt;br/&gt;• Forces HTTP/2 protocol to prevent UDP drops&lt;br/&gt;• Logs events to &lt;b&gt;/var/log/supervisor.log&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#064E3B;strokeColor=#10B981;strokeWidth=2;arcSize=8;align=left;spacingLeft=12;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;" vertex="1" parent="zone_debian">
          <mxGeometry x="30" y="45" width="310" height="130" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <!-- Cloudflared Client -->
        <mxCell id="srv_cloudflared" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color='#FFFFFF' style='font-size: 14px;'&gt;Cloudflare Tunnel Client&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font color='#FED7AA' style='font-size: 11px;'&gt;cloudflared daemon (arm64)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;hr/&gt;&lt;font color='#E2E8F0' style='font-size: 11px;'&gt;• Outbound HTTP/2 mux to Cloudflare Edge&lt;br/&gt;• Credentials: &lt;b&gt;/root/.cloudflared/*.json&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• Config: &lt;b&gt;/root/.cloudflared/config.yml&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• Routes ingress to &lt;b&gt;http://127.0.0.1:8085&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#431407;strokeColor=#F97316;strokeWidth=2;arcSize=8;align=left;spacingLeft=12;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;" vertex="1" parent="zone_debian">
          <mxGeometry x="380" y="45" width="280" height="130" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <!-- Nginx Reverse Proxy -->
        <mxCell id="srv_nginx" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color='#FFFFFF' style='font-size: 16px;'&gt;NGINX WEB GATEWAY &amp; REVERSE PROXY&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font color='#38BDF8' style='font-size: 12px;'&gt;&lt;b&gt;Listening on: 127.0.0.1:8085&lt;/b&gt; (chozzen.xyz)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font color='#94A3B8' style='font-size: 11px;'&gt;Config: /etc/nginx/sites-available/default (sites-enabled/default)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;hr/&gt;&lt;font color='#E2E8F0' style='font-size: 11px;'&gt;• SSL Termination Header Handling (X-Forwarded-Proto, X-Real-IP)&lt;br/&gt;• Reverse Proxies &lt;b&gt;/api/&lt;/b&gt; → Port 8086 | Reverse Proxies &lt;b&gt;/files/&lt;/b&gt; → Port 8080&lt;br/&gt;• Serves Static SPA &amp; Pages from &lt;b&gt;/var/www/dashboard/&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0C4A6E;strokeColor=#0284C7;strokeWidth=3;arcSize=8;align=left;spacingLeft=16;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;" vertex="1" parent="zone_debian">
          <mxGeometry x="30" y="215" width="970" height="115" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <!-- Backend: Static Web Dashboard -->
        <mxCell id="app_static_web" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color='#FFFFFF' style='font-size: 13px;'&gt;Static Webroots&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font color='#7DD3FC' style='font-size: 11px;'&gt;/var/www/dashboard/&lt;/font&gt;&lt;hr/&gt;&lt;font color='#CBD5E1' style='font-size: 11px;'&gt;• &lt;b&gt;index.html&lt;/b&gt; (Dashboard)&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;about.html&lt;/b&gt; (About Page)&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;login.html&lt;/b&gt; (Auth Portal)&lt;br/&gt;• Modern Glassmorphism CSS&lt;br/&gt;• Responsive Tablet &amp; Mobile UI&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#1E293B;strokeColor=#38BDF8;strokeWidth=2;arcSize=8;align=left;spacingLeft=10;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;" vertex="1" parent="zone_debian">
